{
    "title": "Solitaire Sunday: Card Game",
    "description": "Solitaire Sunday: TriPeaks Card Game\r\n\r\nAre you a fan of mobile card games? Introducing Solitaire Sunday, a brand new solitaire card game where the classic gameplay of tripeaks meets unique features! \r\n\r\nThe game is both easy to play and at the same time challenging. You might ask \u201cHow is that so?\u201d Play the game now and see for yourself! You\u2019ll train your brain without even knowing. \r\n\r\nAs you beat levels, you\u2019ll not only earn coins but also encounter different special cards, fun features, and cute backgrounds created only for you. Combos and streaks will reward you with extra coins, extra cards, and some treats! \r\n\r\nLots of features and events await! Including daily missions, jackpots, lucky wheels, special cards and gifts! And more will come, be ready for our surprises! \r\n\r\nSome of the special events are as follows:\r\n-Garden of Spades \r\n-Diamond Museum\r\n-Black Hill \r\n-Soaring Reds\r\n\r\nBeat levels to train your brain & solving these puzzles will keep you entertained! It is fun, challenging, and visually appealing. Come play now!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Solitaire Sunday: TriPeaks Card Game<br><br>Are you a fan of mobile card games? Introducing Solitaire Sunday, a brand new solitaire card game where the classic gameplay of tripeaks meets unique features! <br><br>The game is both easy to play and at the same time challenging. You might ask \u201cHow is that so?\u201d Play the game now and see for yourself! You\u2019ll train your brain without even knowing. <br><br>As you beat levels, you\u2019ll not only earn coins but also encounter different special cards, fun features, and cute backgrounds created only for you. Combos and streaks will reward you with extra coins, extra cards, and some treats! <br><br>Lots of features and events await! Including daily missions, jackpots, lucky wheels, special cards and gifts! And more will come, be ready for our surprises! <br><br>Some of the special events are as follows:<br>-Garden of Spades <br>-Diamond Museum<br>-Black Hill <br>-Soaring Reds<br><br>Beat levels to train your brain &amp; solving these puzzles will keep you entertained! It is fun, challenging, and visually appealing. Come play now!",
